+## Project roadmap
+
+- [x] Implement reference-token allowance and SEP-41 compliance hooks — see [allowance.rs](contracts/rwa-token/src/allowance.rs) and [sep41_compliance.rs](contracts/rwa-token/src/sep41_compliance.rs).
