+- [ ] Validate full reference-token SEP-41 interoperability and negative cases — start with [contracts/rwa-token/](contracts/rwa-token/) and `cargo test --features testutils`; code implementing an interface is not the same as independent compliance verification.
+- [ ] Expand local integration coverage beyond the implemented flows — add focused edge-case scenarios under [tests/integration/lifecycle.test.ts](tests/integration/lifecycle.test.ts); the integration suite requires its own local environment.
+- [ ] Improve deployment and operator tooling — start from [scripts/deploy.sh](scripts/deploy.sh) and the [mainnet readiness guide](docs/mainnet-deployment.md), then document reproducible rollbacks and validation.
+- [ ] Extend the SDK quickstart with tested end-to-end examples — build on [sdk/README.md](sdk/README.md) and `npm run build:sdk`.
+- [ ] Commission an independent Soroban security review — start with the [security disclosure policy](SECURITY.md); the current repository is not independently audited.
 
